            </note>
            <note corresp="#d427-f2" n="2" xml:id="d427-f2-content">
                <p>Not attached.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d427-f3" n="3" xml:id="d427-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 4542 from Cairo, February 12, reported that the UAR Foreign Office had informed the Embassy that the UAR Government had decided to cancel its previous
                    permission for U.S. aircraft to overfly the United Arab Republic carrying arms
                    for Jordan. (National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files
                    1967-69, DEF 17-1 US)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
